<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>快餐 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%BF%AB%E9%A4%90/</link><description>Recent content in 快餐 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%BF%AB%E9%A4%90/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>咖啡店与快餐</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/coffee-shop/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/coffee-shop/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;咖啡店和快餐店是你到美国之后&lt;strong&gt;每周都会进&lt;/strong&gt;的地方，而且它们有一套&lt;strong&gt;固定的话术流程&lt;/strong&gt;——店员翻来覆去就是那几句，你把流程走顺一遍，之后每次都能应付。这一篇四个场景：咖啡店点单、快餐店点套餐、快餐店叫号取餐、咖啡做错了怎么处理。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>